  "summary": "@servicetitan/titan-chat-ui-common preinstall downloads Bun runtime and executes obfuscated in-tree payload",
  "details": "The package declares a preinstall hook (`node setup.mjs`) that downloads the Bun runtime from the oven-sh/bun GitHub releases, marks it executable, and invokes it against a sibling file `math_init.js`. `math_init.js` is a ~727 KB single-line obfuscator-style bundle (hex-named identifiers, rotated ~1000-entry string array with a shuffle routine) whose name and content bear no relation to the package's declared chat UI purpose. Executing the payload under a freshly-fetched alternate runtime rather than Node bypasses Node-based inspection. Installing the package causes the obfuscated blob to run automatically with the installer's privileges.",
